end{aligned}].$ So, the matrix of the system is $A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -7 \\\\ 7 & 0\\end{aligned}].$\n\nGiven the system ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix, the solution of the initial value problem can be written as\n\n$$\nx(t)={Φ}_{0}(t)\\,x(0),\n$$\n\nwhere ${Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}$ is the standard fundamental matrix of the system, and $x(0)$ is the initial condition vector.\n\nNow, using the given information, the standard fundamental matrix ${Φ}_{0}(t)$ of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(7t) & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(7t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={e}^{At}\\,x(0) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(7t) & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(7t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\,-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(7t)-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(7t)\\, \\\\ \\,-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(7t)+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡(7t)\\,\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-335262/field-1" "q-335262/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d611c75-818f-508f-a7a4-49edb32baa41"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-335262"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-335268/selection/e7e17d30a8ba5df56152797c8a32333170f063a7ded0652cf8704ae95241bf88" :answer/id #uuid "e122a47d-b612-501d-8ee3-df62d31a5379" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4t{e}^{6t} \\\\ -4{e}^{6t}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335268/selection/414de1341209d0bff424dfa72b553ae4047dbe6a1c33b1afc9f59ac482ad4997" :answer/id #uuid "a15811ee-0ae2-5086-abcd-3ee1bead34ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-4{e}^{6t} \\\\ -4t{e}^{6t}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/